     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "D(v) = F1 + F2, F1[_j1] = sum_{i in 2..7 : i - 1 == _j1} C[i] s[i], F2[_j1] = sum_{i in 2..7 : i + 1 == _j1} -0.5 C[i] s[i]."
